The end-to-end universal proof has reached the symbolic recursive phase and is taking materially longer than the isolated invariant. I’m letting it continue briefly while watching memory; if cross-claim reuse is not occurring, I’ll restructure the verification definition so the already-proved invariant is available as an explicit generated lemma without weakening the proof obligation.
